{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Pipeline Telemetry.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Pipeline Telemetry.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai pipeline telemetry ai pipeline telemetry","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Pipeline Telemetry.md","fileName":"AI Pipeline Telemetry.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Pipeline Telemetry","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Pipeline Engineering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Pipeline Engineering","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Pipeline Telemetry.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Pipeline Telemetry.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai pipeline telemetry ai pipeline telemetry","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Pipeline Telemetry.md","fileName":"AI Pipeline Telemetry.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Pipeline Telemetry","heading":"AI Pipeline Telemetry","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"AI pipeline telemetry records the model call as an observable dependency. Useful fields include timestamp, prompt and input sizes, HTTP status, duration, prompt tokens, completion tokens, and total tokens, along with references to the controlled input and generated output.\n\nThe workflow can publish these values in an artifact and a job summary, then emit warning annotations when usage or latency exceeds a threshold. Telemetry supports cost analysis, performance tuning, audit, and failure diagnosis without requiring an engineer to infer model behavior from the final text alone.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Pipeline Engineering","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Pipeline Telemetry.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Pipeline Telemetry.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai pipeline telemetry ai pipeline telemetry","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Pipeline Telemetry.md","fileName":"AI Pipeline Telemetry.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Pipeline Telemetry","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Pipeline Engineering","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}